	(text "LPDDR4 x32: U501 DDR block -> U801 (2 channels x16, single rank). Wiring per TI135_PCB_NOTES.md §6.1\n(Efinix Ti375C529 kit). DQ swizzled within each byte (LPDDR4_SWIZZLE.md, efinity/pinplan/lpddr4_swizzle.json,\nInterface Designer PIN_SWIZZLE_DQM0-3). Never DM/DQS/bytes/channels; CA not swizzled.\nRouting: §6.3 (40 R SE / 80 R diff, include package net lengths)."
